*.dll

# rust / cargo
target/
Cargo.lock

# node
node_modules/

# tree-sitter scratch
*.o
*.wasm

# tree-sitter generated files: these are build outputs of `grammar.js` (the source
# of truth) and are regenerated in-tree by `bindings/rust/build.rs` (via the pinned
# `tree-sitter-cli`) when they are missing or older than the grammar. Only
# `grammar.js` + the `.scm` queries are committed.
src/parser.c
src/grammar.json
src/node-types.json
src/tree_sitter/
